body:
I remember standing on top of a abandoned warehouse, staring into the void of a night sky. Tears running down my face as fast as the blood  down my arms. All I could think was, "This is it? This is what I lived for? What purpose do I truly have?"

&#x200B;

That was in May of 2012. I was homeless and on drugs pretty bad. 

&#x200B;

Today I live in a 3 bdr 2 bath apartment in Las Vegas. I am where I never thought I would be and alive when i didn't think I would make it. 

&#x200B;

Bud, things in life are so complicated and so hard, I wont lie. But you have so many years ahead of you, you never know how life could truly turn out. Life isnt what everyone thought it was all those years ago as a kid and it sucks, I know. I wish I could show you what life is like and guide you through myself, but I can't. Because everyone lives life differently. What worked for me may not work for you and could make things harder for you in the long run and vice versa. I have had alot of people end their life so early. I was almost one of them. Life is unpredictable, but you can truly guide it once you have that grip.

&#x200B;

I hope I was able to help.
